# Orquestrador — history watch

Responsabilidade: com config/histórico de watch no contexto, acionar `history-watch`. Pedidos `/historico` sem arquivo aberto → **intent**.

| Sinal no contexto | Skills / command |
| --- | --- |
| `.cursor/history/**`, `watches.json` | `history-watch` |
| rule `history-watch-*.mdc` | `history-watch` |
| `format=okf-log` no watch | `history-watch` + `okf` |
| setup / off / status | command `/historico` |

